    "text": "When a CRM bill doubles due to added seats, you can optimize licenses, renegotiate terms, or migrate to alternative pricing structures.\nAudit and Reclaim Inactive Licenses\nRight-Size User Roles and Tiers\nNegotiate or Adjust the Contract\nEvaluate Alternative Pricing Models\nIf you share which CRM you are using (e.g., HubSpot, Salesforce, Monday) and what roles your new users have (e.g., full sales vs. occasional viewers), I can give you the exact steps to trim the licenses.",
